<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-GIO year net profit up 1.1 pct.</title>
<headline>RTRS-GIO year net profit up 1.1 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to June 30</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		    202.1 vs 203.1</p>
<p>    Net				     142.2 vs 140.6</p>
<p>    Final dividend (cents)	     10.0 vs 9.0</p>
<p>NOTE: GIO Australia Holdings Ltd is a New South Wales-based insurance group. Net profit is after the transfer of funds to the disaster reserve of A$8.0 million vs $16.0 million a year earlier.  </p>
<p>    Total dividend (cents)	     19.0 vs   18.0</p>
<p>    Sales				  1472.2 vs 1523.2</p>
<p>    Other income			  650.9 vs  865.7</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)			    24.6 vs   25.4</p>
<p>    Abnormal items			 nil  vs  nil</p>
<p>Dividend is fully franked</p>
<p>Pay date November 5, reg date October 11</p>
<p>    Tax					53.9 vs  48.0</p>
<p>    Interest				 90.6 vs  76.0</p>
<p>    Depreciation			   22.1 vs  24.5</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 373 1800</p>
</text>
